msgid "Established in 1995, Royal Hotel has been the premier destination for travelers seeking a perfect blend of luxury, comfort, and heritage."
msgstr "Kuanzishwa mwaka 1995, Royal Hotel imekuwa kituo bora kwa wasafiri wanaotafuta mchanganyiko wa anasa, faraja, na urithi."

